<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5381"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 7:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey Homey, I am just glad guns are not issued with message board accounts!  Shoot first ask later.  How funny is that, people thinking you are BTK?  ROTFLMAO!!!  Now I have a better appreciation for the whole &#34;what constitutes a tip&#34; topic.   <BR> <BR>I am glad to know it is you, I will pay more attention to it.  How long have they been making those closelines?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5381-->
<!--Post: 5384--><!--Time: 1107099360-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5384"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 7:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dorothy:  Sorry for the mistaken identity. Darn, I thought I was onto something!  Lol-- At least it&#39;s a good lesson in how easy it is to go off on a wild goose chase. <BR> <BR>As for the trolls and other disruptive posters, I&#39;d hate to see a good forum like this one go dead because of that.  Like in Usenet, I think the best solution is to just ignore them.  Don&#39;t take the bait. <BR> <BR>I think the Coleman connection was a good point to bring up, though.  Too bad we don&#39;t have more details about where the clothesline may have come from.  I guess the clothesline may have been from a backyard clothesline, but if that were the case it would be difficult for BTK to access quickly -- those things are usually pretty high off the ground and are tied up tightly.  Maybe he brought it with him in his &#34;kit,&#34; the bag he apparently brought with him to at least one crime scene &#40;Viand&#41;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5384-->
<!--Post: 5403--><!--Time: 1107108281-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5403"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 10:04 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dorothy - If BTK ever worked at Coleman, he may have had access to as much clothesline as he could hide and walk out with....Just a thought.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5403-->
<!--Post: 5426--><!--Time: 1107116844-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5426"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 12:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dorothy - I was throwing in with Audrey, Dee and Chiquitah. Nothing more.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
