<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10866"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 10:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->B- they all got laid off from one of the aircraft plants and went to work at Coleman!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10866-->
<!--Post: 11426--><!--Time: 1110694846-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11426"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 10:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Coleman&#39;s position on this crime: <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_packages/btk/11025225.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_pack ages/btk/11025225.htm</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11426-->
<!--Post: 11427--><!--Time: 1110695013-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11427"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 10:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->To answer your question Bmodule! <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/11117709.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/11117709.htm</a> <BR>Now the economy is really going to crap.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
